{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA699581","title":"Full-Scale Low-temperature Anaerobic Wastewater Treatment","description":"Here, we demonstrate for the first time, direct, high-rate, low-temperature AD of low-strength municipal wastewater at full-scale. An 88 m3 hybrid EGSB reactor equipped with a pumice-stone fixed-film filter was installed at the municipal wastewater treatment plant in Builth Wells, UK and operated for 290 days. Ambient temperatures ranged from 2-18C, but remained below 15C for >100 days. Influent BOD fluctuated between 2-200 mg L-1. Regardless of these extreme conditions, we report successful, robust treatment of BOD with removal often reaching >90%. 16S rRNA sequencing of DNA from the biomass revealed a highly adaptable core microbiome supporting the process.","center":"National University of Ireland Galway","data_type":"Raw sequence reads","submission_date":"2021/02/04 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN17799085","Aug19_1","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2019-08-01",2019,"GB","Wales",2654359,"Builth Wells","probable",52.15,-3.4,"United Kingdom: Wales","anaerobic biofilms",null,null,null,"city-level location without sample-site confirmation"],["SAMN17799086","Aug19_2","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2019-08-01",2019,"GB","Wales",2654359,"Builth Wells","probable",52.15,-3.4,"United Kingdom: Wales","anaerobic biofilms",null,null,null,"city-level location without sample-site confirmation"],["SAMN17799087","Aug19_3","probable_urban","municipal_wastewater","2019-08-01",2019,"GB","Wales",2654359,"Builth Wells","probable",52.15,-3.4,"United Kingdom: Wales","anaerobic biofilms",null,null,null,"city-level location without sample-site confirmation"],["SAMN17799088","Aug19_4","probable_urban","